{"title": "Twist of Fortune (passive feature)", "pageid": 28072, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Twist_of_Fortune_(passive_feature)", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Twist of Fortune</b> is a passive feature that increases the consistency of the wielder's weapon damage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you roll 2 or less with this weapon's damage die, reroll it and take the new result. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Twist_of_Fortune\" title=\"Twist of Fortune\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Twist_of_Fortune\" title=\"Twist of Fortune\">Twist of Fortune</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The Twist of Fortune passive appears to affect all melee damage rolls while equipped, not just damage with <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Twist_of_Fortune\" title=\"Twist of Fortune\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Twist_of_Fortune\" title=\"Twist of Fortune\">Twist of Fortune</a> itself.</li>\n<li>This passive stacks with itself (via a second copy of the weapon using the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invoke_Duplicity\" title=\"Invoke Duplicity\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Invoke_Duplicity_Icon.webp/20px-Invoke_Duplicity_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Invoke_Duplicity_Icon.webp/30px-Invoke_Duplicity_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Invoke_Duplicity_Icon.webp/40px-Invoke_Duplicity_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invoke Duplicity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Invoke_Duplicity_Icon.webp/20px-Invoke_Duplicity_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Invoke_Duplicity_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Invoke_Duplicity\" title=\"Invoke Duplicity\">Invoke Duplicity</a> exploit) or by dual wielding with the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King\" title=\"Knife of the Undermountain King\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King\" title=\"Knife of the Undermountain King\">Knife of the Undermountain King</a>. The damage improvement of the second reroll is smaller than the first one.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714223406\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1804/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 16270/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6474/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursi